<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>RyuDetails</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
    rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #103B6B;
        }
        .card-body {
            background-color: #CC8D04;
            border:#CC8D04
        }
        .btn {
            background-color: #CC8D04;
            border-color: #CC8D04;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="index.html">SF6 Character Database</a>
                <div class="navbar-nav">
                    <a class="nav-link active" href="about.html">About SF6</a>
                    <a class="nav-link" href="new-character-form.html">Add New SF6 Character</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>
    <div class="container mt-5">
        <h1 class="text-center text-white">Ryu</h1>
        <p class="text-center text-white">A wandering martial artist seeking to perfect his skills.</p>
        <div class="card mb-4 shadow-sm">
            <img src="https://www.streetfighter.com/6/assets/images/character/ryu/sns.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="Ryu">
            <div class="card-body">
                <p class="text-left text-dark">Ryu is a central character in the Street Fighter series, 
                    known for his disciplined training and pursuit of martial arts mastery. 
                    He is often depicted as a stoic and focused fighter, 
                    traveling the world to challenge strong opponents and improve his skills. 
                    Ryu's signature moves include the Hadouken, Shoryuken, and Tatsumaki Senpukyaku, 
                    which have become iconic in the fighting game genre.
                    He first appeared in Street Fighter in 1987,
                    and has since become one of the most recognizable characters in video game history.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <a href="index.html" class="btn btn-primary text-dark">Back to Characters</a>

</body>
</html>